 class="template13_leftSide__z7YPA"><div class="summarySection_summaryWrapper__CP521" data-ats-section="Summary"><h3 class="summarySection_title__zRosi" data-split-not-last="true">Summary</h3><div class="summarySection_text__LRUSJ">Senior
 Analyst with 5+ years of experience in data analysis, business 
intelligence, and process optimization. Skilled in driving operational 
efficiency, forecasting, and leading data-driven strategies to support 
business decisions and improvements. Strong communicator focused on 
