maintenance and minor repairs on vehicles. Committed to the safety and 
successful transportation of goods, passengers, and vehicles.</div></div><div class="workSection_wrapper__ozOrq" data-ats-section="Experience"><div class="title_titleWrapper___qDju" data-split-not-last="true"><div class="title_textWrapper__7y1dG"><h3 class="title_title__5V6IL"><div class="title_titleIcon__3VTEJ"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 7h.006m2.327-3.5V2.334a1.167 1.167 0 0 0-1.166-1.167H5.833a1.167 1.167 0 0 0-1.166 1.167V3.5m8.166 4.084a10.59 10.59 0 0 1-11.666 0M2.333 3.5h9.334c.644 0 1.166.523 1.166 1.167V10.5c0 .645-.522 1.167-1.166 1.167H2.333A1.167 1.167 0 0 1 1.167 10.5V4.667c0-.644.522-1.167 1.166-1.167"></path></svg></div><span>Experience</span></h3></div><div class="title_emptyDiv__aUGX6"></div></div><ul class="workSection_list__t_tDF"><li class="workSection_workWrapper__x2uoq"><div class="workSection_workLeftInfo__otZLM"><div class="workSection_circle__BxVn4"></div><div class="workSection_line__WPhK3"></div><div class="workSection_workDate__Q_5_p">Mar 2013 — Jul 2019</div></div><div class="workSection_workRightInfo__0ngzw"><div class="workSection_jobTitle__vnpl8">Driver</div><div class="workSection_jobCompany__2sOiQ">Albert's Trucking Company, Phoenix</div><div class="workSection_jobDescription__A3VCJ"><ul><li>Performed vehicle inspections and maintenance prior to trips.</li><li>Read maps and identified the fastest routes.</li></ul></div></div></li><li class="workSection_workWrapper__x2uoq"><div class="workSection_workLeftInfo__otZLM"><div class="workSection_circle__BxVn4"></div><div class="workSection_workDate__Q_5_p">Aug 2009 — Feb 2013</div></div><div class="workSection_workRightInfo__0ngzw"><div class="workSection_jobTitle__vnpl8">Driver</div><div class="workSection_jobCompany__2sOiQ">Bears Transportation, Phoenix</div><div class="workSection_jobDescription__A3VCJ"><ul><li>Reached 700k accident free miles.</li><li>Was awarded Best Driver in 2011.</li><li>Safely and efficiently transported cargo to destinations.</li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div><div class="educationSection_wrapper__TE3TB" data-ats-section="Education"><div class="title_titleWrapper___qDju" data-split-not-last="true"><div class="title_textWrapper__7y1dG"><h3 class="title_title__5V6IL"><div class="title_titleIcon__3VTEJ"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 4.083A2.333 2.333 0 0 0 4.667 1.75h-3.5v8.75H5.25A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 7 12.25m0-8.167v8.167m0-8.167A2.333 2.333 0 0 1 9.333 1.75h3.5v8.75H8.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 0 7 12.25M3.5 4.667h1.167M3.5 7h1.167m4.666-2.333H10.5M9.333 7H10.5"></path></svg></div><span>Education</span></h3></div><div class="title_emptyDiv__aUGX6"></div></div><ul class="educationSection_list__mbFMB"><div class="educationSection_educWrapper__T7i_t"><div class="educationSection_educLeftInfo__54B34"><div class="educationSection_circle__Dsvkp"></div><div class="educationSection_educDate__e0zUR">2013 - 2017</div></div><div class="educationSection_educRightInfo__RrYiz"><div class="educationSection_schoolName__OP5TG">Phoenix Driving School</div><div class="educationSection_degree__aOrl8">Class BCommercial Driver's LicensePhoenix</div><div class="educationSection_educDescription__JriGF"></div></div></div></ul></div></div><div class="template3_rightSide__58K5C"><div class="infoSection_wrapper__me5az"><div class="infoSection_email__Z5TNL"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="none" class="infoSection_icon__zNEWp"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#fff"></circle><path fill="#02061B" d="M14.5 6h-9c-.398 0-.78.147-1.06.407a1.34 1.34 0 0 0-.44.984v5.218c0 .369.158.723.44.983.28.261.662.408 1.06.408h9c.398 0 .78-.147 1.06-.408.282-.26.44-.614.44-.983V7.39a1.34 1.34 0 0 0-.44-.984A1.56 1.56 0 0 0 14.5 6m-6.862 5.117-1.5 1.39a.4.4 0 0 1-.483-.044.33.33 0 0 1-.031-.449l1.5-1.391a.4.4 0 0 1 .264-.101c.1 0 .194.036.264.1a.33.33 0 0 1 .07.383.4.4 0 0 1-.085.112Zm2.