1 0 0 0 1.41-.013L16.08 9.24a.927.927 0 1 1 1.316 1.307l-5.923 5.923a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 0l-3.398-3.398a.88.88 0 0 1 1.236-1.25" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><div class="template19_wrapper__3_LV4 template19_predefinedData__HsQGt template19_overflowShow__syw_6" data-template-wrapper="true"><div data-template-header="true"><div class="headingSection_headerSectionWrapper__YSetJ"><div class="headingSection_imgContainer__TZLff"><img id="imageLink" alt="Your Photo" class="headingSection_img__GogWq" src="BetterCV_files/template19.webp"></div><div class="headingSection_content__Rdupt"><p class="headingSection_name__oDeA5">Matthew Jones</p><p class="headingSection_jobTitle__uOFGr">Financial Analyst</p></div></div></div><div class="template19_content__vup3p" data-template-body="true"><div class="template19_leftSide___6eN6"><div class="summarySection_summaryWrapper__9jD1_" data-ats-section="Summary"><div class="title-left_titleWrapper__KwHce" data-split-not-last="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 10 10"><path fill="#02061B" d="M6.832 4.488a2.517 2.517 0 0 0 0-3.601 2.62 2.62 0 0 0-3.663 0 2.517 2.517 0 0 0 0 3.601 2.62 2.62 0 0 0 3.663 0M5 5.797C2.744 5.797.91 7.6.91 9.819c0 .047.018.092.052.125s.08.052.127.052h7.823a.18.18 0 0 0 .127-.052.18.18 0 0 0 .052-.125c0-2.218-1.835-4.022-4.09-4.022"></path></svg><h3 class="title-left_title__3fFGx">Summary</h3></div><div class="summarySection_text__6wPpn">Experienced
 and driven Financial Analyst with an impressive background in managing 
multi-million dollar budgets. Provides analysis and account support 
within product development departments. Works to reduce business 
expenses and develop logical and advantageous operating plan budgets. 
Experienced in creating quarterly accruals based on trends and 
forecasted expenses.</div></div><div class="workSection_wrapper__XWIdv" data-ats-section="Experience"><div class="title-left_titleWrapper__KwHce" data-split-not-last="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 10 10"><path fill="#02061B" d="M9.91 2.748v5.856q-.008.005-.012.014c-.122.402-.348.57-.769.57-2.773 0-5.547-.004-8.32.004a.744.744 0 0 1-.765-.767c.009-1.84.004-3.68.004-5.519 0-.467.29-.758.755-.759h2.061V1.13c0-.25.14-.391.385-.391h3.457c.247 0 .386.14.387.39v1.018h2.099c.346 0 .608.206.697.538zM3.575 2.14H6.38v-.695H3.575z"></path><path fill="#02061B" d="M.806 9.237a.8.8 0 0 1-.575-.23.8.8 0 0 1-.23-.58C.006 7.095.005 5.74.004 4.43V2.908c0-.494.306-.802.798-.803H2.82v-.974c0-.272.161-.435.43-.435h3.458c.268 0 .43.162.43.434v.975h2.055c.362.002.645.22.74.57l.013.041.008.027v5.879l-.01.012-.006.006c-.129.415-.371.593-.809.593h-2.1c-2.039 0-4.147-.001-6.22.004zm.78-7.045H.803c-.438 0-.71.275-.71.715V4.43c0 1.31.002 2.664-.005 3.996a.72.72 0 0 0 .205.518.72.72 0 0 0 .513.205h.002c2.074-.006 4.183-.005 6.221-.005h2.1c.4 0 .61-.156.726-.539a.1.1 0 0 1 .01-.019v-5.83l-.004-.013-.014-.045a.65.65 0 0 0-.655-.505H7.05V1.13c0-.227-.119-.347-.342-.347H3.249c-.22 0-.34.123-.341.347v1.062zm4.839-.006H3.53v-.782h2.893zm-2.806-.088h2.717V1.49H3.62z"></path></svg><h3 class="title-left_title__3fFGx">Experience</h3></div><ul class="workSection_list__dSVJK"><li class="workSection_listItem__onNUD"><p class="workSection_workTitle__KgzQs">Financial Analyst, GEO Corp, New York</p><p class="workSection_date__AbNW5">Mar 2012 — Jul 2018</p><div class="workSection_workDescription__6FGBg"><ul><li>Created budgets and ensured that labor and material costs were decreased by 15%.</li><li>Generated financial reports on completed projects, including advantageous results.</li><li>Developed financial statements, including cash flow charts and balance sheets.</li></ul></div></li><li class="workSection_listItem__onNUD"><p class="workSection_workTitle__KgzQs">Financial Analyst, Sisco Enterprises, New York</p><p class="workSection_date__AbNW5">Aug 2008 — Feb 2012</p><div class="workSection_workDescription__6FGBg"><ul><li>Provided reports, cash flow analysis, annual operating plan budgets, monthly cash forecasts, and revenue projections.</li><li>Analyzed corporate accounts and advised in negotiations bringing budget savings.</li><li>Coordinated with key finance reports and presented the results to management.</li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div class="educationSection_wrapper__ZbWVn" data-ats-section="Education"><div class="title-left_titleWrapper__KwHce" data-split-not-last="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 10 10"><path fill="#02061B" d="m9.99 7.52-.155-.777a.52.52 0 0 0-.323-.382V4.273l-.383.191V6.36a.52.52 0 0 0-.323.382l-.156.775c-.02.098-.009.2.032.291l.256.58a.42.42 0 0 0 .443.244.415.415 0 0 0 .322-.245l.256-.58c.04-.09.051-.19.032-.286M6.085 5.986c-.362.151-.75.231-1.143.236a3 3 0 0 1-.665-.077l-.023-.005-.024-.004-.024-.006q-.075-.019-.136-.036l-.013-.003-.09-.03q-.21-.067-.409-.162l-.008-.005-.227-.124a135 135 0 0 1-1.128-.567v1.794a.78.78 0 0 0 .543.742l1.079.348a3.63 3.63 0 0 0 2.227 0l1.08-.348a.78.78 0 0 0 .541-.742V5.195l-.712.362q-.42.24-.868.429"></path><path fill="#02061B" d="m9.289 3.954.51-.257a.11.11 0 0 0 .045-.157.1.1 0 0 0-.044-.039L6.114 1.644a2.63 2.63 0 0 0-2.368 0L.061 3.501a.107.107 0 0 0-.045.155.1.1 0 0 0 .046.041l1.98 1q.026.006.048.017l1.314.665.006.003.093.052c.404.2.54.255.672.294l.115.03h.01a.2.2 0 0 1 .042.01h.005l.153.03c.05.008.096.013.148.018a2.6 2.6 0 0 0 .814-.038q.245-.055.48-.15l.038-.016.008-.004q.063-.026.124-.057l.662-.334.035-.02c.28-.153.568-.31.886-.447l.075-.038a.2.2 0 0 1 .044-.016l1.371-.69a.2.2 0 0 1 .104-.052"></path></svg><h3 class="title-left_title__3fFGx">Education</h3></div><ul class="educationSection_list__oHAwO"><li class="educationSection_listItem__7dG4j"><p class="educationSection_educationTitle__4ffcM">Bachelor, Finance, Villanova University, King of Prussia</p><p class="educationSection_date__gjUUb">2004 — 2008</p><div class="educationSection_educationDescription__GFEzy">Graduated summa cum laude.</div></li><li class="educationSection_listItem__7dG4j"><p class="educationSection_educationTitle__4ffcM">Bachelor of Science, Yale University</p><p class="educationSection_date__gjUUb">2000 — 2004</p><div class="educationSection_educationDescription__GFEzy">Graduated summa cum laude.</div></li><li class="educationSection_listItem__7dG4j"><p class="educationSection_educationTitle__4ffcM">High School Diploma, Camden High School, Camden</p><p class="educationSection_date__gjUUb">1996 — 2000</p><div class="educationSection_educationDescription__GFEzy"></div></li></ul></div></div><div class="template19_rightSide__h8ezO"><div><h3 class="title-right_title__q3RNQ">Details</h3><div class="infoSection_infoSection__TYm0W"><div class="infoSection_email__Ua6Kq">MJones@email.com</div><div class="infoSection_location__8_r4U">333 Oaklahoma Road, New York,  United States,  10024</div><div class="infoSection_phone__blZGv">(917) 947-5112</div></div></div><div class="template19_innerRightSide__DUh5a"><div class="skillsSection_wrapper__t7M0B" data-ats-section="Skills"><div class="title-left_titleWrapper__KwHce" data-split-not-last="true"><h3 class="title-left_title__3fFGx">Skills</h3></div><ul class="skillsSection_list__ejiJA"><li class="skillsSection_item__aw_BN undefined"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__K8ICN">Financial Analysis</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__aw_BN undefined"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__K8ICN">Strategic Planning</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__aw_BN undefined"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__K8ICN">Trend Analysis</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__aw_BN undefined"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__K8ICN">Market Assessment</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__aw_BN undefined"><div><p class="ski