l.com</div><div class="headingSection_phone__vtQEm">+381616060488</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="template13_sidesWrapper__XiP_B" data-template-body="true"><div class="template13_leftSide__z7YPA"><div class="summarySection_summaryWrapper__CP521 undefined" data-ats-section="Summary"><h3 class="summarySection_title__zRosi" data-split-not-last="true">Summary</h3><div class="summarySection_text__LRUSJ"><p>Final-
year Applied Software Engineering student with hands-on experience in 
full-stack and backend development, database management, and web 
application design. Skilled in Python, C#, SQL (PostgreSQL/SQL Server), 
Flask, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-link" href="http://asp.net/">ASP.NET</a>,
 React, REST APIs, and real-time systems. Experienced in working 
collaboratively in teams, communicating effectively with peers, and 
organizing project tasks efficiently. Strong problem-solving abilities, 
adaptable, and motivated to contribute to software development, IT 
solutions, and technical support roles in dynamic environments.</p></div></div><div class="skillsSection_wrapper__DbReT" data-ats-section="Skills"><h3 class="skillsSection_title__U0ANi" data-split-not-last="true">Skills</h3><ul class="skillsSection_list__zskqY"><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">Full-Stack Development</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">Database Management</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">Team Collaboration</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">C#</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">Python</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">HTML/CSS</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">C++</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">Object-Oriented Programming</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">Problem solving</p></div></li><li class="skillsSection_item__ijpL1 skillsSection_defaultStyle__pdXYP skillsSection_withoutRating__wYzDB" data-split-avoid="true"><div><p class="skillsSection_text__htoIv">Git</p></div></li></ul></div></div><div class="template13_rightSide__nDvcw"><div class="workSection_wrapper__QDGbp" data-ats-section="Experience"><h3 class="workSection_title__R0cH0" data-split-not-last="true">Experience</h3><ul class="workSection_list__QvSwC"><li class="workSection_listItem__xMpqK"><div class="workSection_listHeader__CyT6j"><div class="workSection_jobTitle__7NZzf">Software Engineering Student <span class="workSection_date__pwrZu"></span></div><p class="workSection_text__ZvWjJ">University Of Technical Sciences - Novi Sad </p></div><div class="workSection_listWrapper__oo_dI"><p>•  Flight Management System – University Project</p><p>•  (Python, Flask, REST API, WebSockets, PostgreSQL, React)</p><p>•  Designed and implemented a web-based system for managing flights using a microservice architecture</p><p>•  Developed backend services in Python (Flask) with REST API and JWT-based authentication</p><p>•  Implemented real-time notifications using WebSockets for flight approval and status updates</p><p>•  Worked with PostgreSQL database for storing user and flight data</p><p>•  Implemented user roles (User, Manager, Administrator) with different permissions</p><p>•  Enabled asynchronous flight booking and rating system after flight completion</p><p>•  Stack Overflow–style Q&amp;A Platform – University Project</p><p>•  (C#, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-link" href="http://asp.net/">ASP.NET</a> Core, SQL Server, Azure, Web APIs, Background Services)</p><p>•  Designed and developed a web-based question-and-answer platform inspired by StackOverflow</p><p>•  Implemented user registration, authentication, profile management, question posting, editing, deletion, and voting system</p><p>•  Developed backend services with C# and <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-link" href="http://asp.net/">ASP.NET</a> Core Web APIs, including role-based permissions</p><p>•
  Built asynchronous email notification system for question updates and 
best answer selection using Azure queues and NotificationService</p><p>•  Worked with SQL Server database for storing user, question, answer, and notification data</p><p>•  Enabled users to mark best answers, track responses, and receive real-time updates via email</p></div></li></ul></div><div class="educationSection_wrapper__Ti_om" data-ats-section="Education"><h3 class="educationSection_title__Sof8M" data-split-not-last="true">Education</h3><ul class="educationSection_list__jngxJ"><li class="educationSection_listItem__RMFVj"><div class="educationSection_listHeader__d19OL"><div class="educationSection_schoolTitle__aBxAl"><span>University Of Technical Sciences</span><span>2021</span></div><p class="educationSection_schoolLocation__Y7TdK">Novi Sad | BSc in Applied Software Engineering  </p></div><div class="educationSection_listWrapper__W_lax"><p>Currently in the final year of Applied Software Engineering studies.</p></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div style="width: 100%; height: 891.53px; overflow: visible;" data-template-scale-container="true"><div style="width: 745px; min-height: 1054.27px; height: auto; transform: scale(0.845638); transform-origin: left top 0px; visibility: visible;"><div class="carousel__wrapper"><div class="styles_viewport__FusYC" style="height: 1054.27px; width: 745px;"><div class="styles_container__xmBc7" data-template-split-container="true" style="--template-section-spacing: 24px; --template-paragraph-spacing: 16px; --template-body-line-spacing: 1.51; --template-label-line-spacing: 1.17; --components-template13-main-color: var(--color-soapstone); --components-template13-secondary-color: undefined; --components-template13-main-text-color: undefined; --components-template13-secondary-text-color: undefined; --components-template13-tertiary-text-color: undefined; --template-font-size: 14px; --template-font-family: Times New Roman;"><div class="styles_slide__PKPsq" style="height: 1054.27px; width: 745px; transform: translateX(0px)